-- Other words just as right in a sentence (salen/cuestan, celu/celular/teléfono, plata/guita/dinero,
-- re/muy, laburo/trabajo…): swaps within groups of interchangeable words, kept only when two
-- independent agent judges (.course-work/synonyms/JUDGE*.md) said a Buenos Aires teacher would mark
-- them right for the English. Typed gaps accept them (gradeGap). Additive: an alternative already
-- stored is not added twice.

